# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BETZ360 ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: never commit a real .env file. Copy this to .env and
# fill in real values. The .env file is gitignored.
#
# These all live in Netlify (Site Settings → Environment variables)
# and are used by serverless functions only — never bundled into
# the public frontend.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The Odds API — used by netlify/functions/props.js
# Sign up: https://the-odds-api.com
ODDS_API_KEY=your_odds_api_key_here

# OpenWeather API — used by netlify/functions/weather.js
# Sign up: https://openweathermap.org/api
WEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweather_api_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY RULES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. NO key should start with VITE_ — Vite bundles VITE_* into the
#    public frontend visible to everyone.
#
# 2. NO key should be hardcoded as a fallback in any source file.
#    If process.env.X is undefined, return an error response.
#
# 3. All third-party API calls should go through a Netlify function,
#    not directly from the browser.
#
# 4. Rotate any key immediately if it's been:
#    - committed to git (even briefly)
#    - shared in chat/Slack/email
#    - included in a screenshot
#    - logged anywhere outside Netlify itself
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
